helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596				0	fi	Note that the formats are subject to certain licenses. You can find notes on the licenses at the start of the DTD files. More detailed information can be found on the \<link href=\"https://www.openoffice.org\" name=\"Apache OpenOffice\"\>Apache OpenOffice\</link\> website.				20200411 15:09:53
