helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3155871				0	fi	If you cannot place your cursor in the index or table of contents, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</item\>, and then select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Enable\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Cursor in protected areas\</item\> section.				20200411 15:09:53
